# Phase 5: Refinement & Real Data Integration

This phase focuses on transitioning from mock data to real API integration and implementing the core Learning Experience (Course Player).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Dashboard Stats**: I will implement a unified `DashboardController` to provide specialized stats for each user role.
> - **Course Player**: The player will focus on video/text content navigation within the browser.
> - **Enrollment Flow**: For the MVP, I'll ensure students can "enroll" (join) courses from the catalog.

## Proposed Changes

### [Backend] Dashboard Refinement

#### [NEW] [DashboardController](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/app/Http/Controllers/DashboardController.php)
- Implement `stats()` method that detects user role and returns:
    - **Student**: Enrolled courses count, certificates count, overall progress %.
    - **Instructor**: Revenue summary (sum of payments for their courses), total student count.
    - **Admin**: Platform-wide stats (tenants, users, courses).

#### [MODIFY] [EnrollmentController](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Enrollments/app/Http/Controllers/EnrollmentController.php)
- Ensure `index()` returns enrolled courses with progress.

---

