### [Frontend] Course Player & Catalog

#### [MODIFY] [Course Catalog](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/courses/page.tsx)
- Fetch real courses from `GET /api/courses`.
- Add "Enroll" button (if not enrolled) or "Continue" button (if already enrolled).

#### [NEW] [Course Player Page](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/courses/%5Bid%5D/learn/page.tsx)
